  "story": {
    "spreadingFlames": {
      "introTitle": "Scenario I: Spreading Flames",
      "intro": "A wave of fires and strange \"accidents\" has Arkham on edge, and hooded figures have been seen near every one of them.\n\nYour friend is sure they are to blame and asked you to meet at their dorm room at Miskatonic University. When you arrive, the room is empty and the building far too quiet…",
      "noResolutionTitle": "No resolution",
      "noResolution": "You come to at the edge of campus, eyes stinging from the smoke, as the university burns building after building.\n\nIn the chaos you find Dr. Henry Armitage, stunned before the ruins of the library. Too many questions remain: who was chasing you, and what did the hooded figures want?",
      "resolution1Title": "Resolution 1",
      "resolution1": "Dozens of students band together to fight the blaze. Dr. Armitage puts a hand on your shoulder: if you want to find your friend and whoever took them, you must leave now, and he will explain everything on the way.\n\nYou could stay and help, but it would cost you precious time.",
      "armitageBearerTitle": "Dr. Henry Armitage",
      "armitageBearer": "Choose which investigator becomes the bearer of Dr. Henry Armitage. This story asset is added to their deck ignoring deckbuilding rules and does not count toward deck size.",
      "decideTitle": "What do you do?",
      "decide": "The investigators must decide.",
      "stay": "Stay and fight the fire! (Resolution 2)",
      "go": "\"There's no time. We have to go.\" (Resolution 3)",
      "resolution2Title": "Resolution 2",
      "resolution2": "Working side by side with the others, you hold back the flames until the Arkham Fire Department arrives. With things under control, you hurry to meet Dr. Armitage.",
      "resolution3Title": "Resolution 3",
      "resolution3": "You flee the campus with Dr. Armitage and leave the university to its fate, sirens wailing behind you on the way to his apartment."
    },
